msgid "Using security with JDBC"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use a database to "
"store your user identities."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr ""

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr ""

msgid "JDK 17+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr ""

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image."
"adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a "
"native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this example, we build a very simple microservice which offers three "
"endpoints:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/api/public`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/api/users/me`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/api/admin`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `/api/public` endpoint can be accessed anonymously.\n"
"The `/api/admin` endpoint is protected with RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) "
"where only users granted with the `admin` role can access. At this endpoint, "
"we use the `@RolesAllowed` annotation to declaratively enforce the access "
"constraint.\n"
"The `/api/users/me` endpoint is also protected with RBAC (Role-Based Access "
"Control) where only users granted with the `user` role can access. As a "
"response, it returns a JSON document with details about the user."
msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and "
"create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the completed example."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download "
"an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The solution is located in the `security-jdbc-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-"
"tree-url}/security-jdbc-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Creating the Maven Project"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"First, we need a new project. Create a new project with the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""

msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` "
"option."
msgstr ""

